    "updated_at": "2024-04-17T14:24:55Z",
    "body": "Are you talking about https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-serviceworkerregistration-shownotification?\r\n\r\nI think the difference is somewhat observable as the permission check `TypeError` comes from a task. And I think that's somewhat important as we wouldn't want to require synchronous IPC for a permission check.",
