    "body": "Hmm, it seems both [Blink](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/notifications/notification_manager.cc;l=77;drc=9e110c64fee9c391021dc81944912f906e6ba5d5) and [WebKit](https://searchfox.org/wubkat/rev/25be8d6371093c7bc40042867d31fcb62659346c/Source/WebCore/workers/WorkerNotificationClient.cpp#99-110) indeed tries to synchronously ping something outside of the current thread, although I don't think Gecko does that (as we [propagate permissions beforehand](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/2c3d657cbba5484ccac44443c4417baed7b5fafb/dom/ipc/WindowGlobalParent.cpp#155)). I'm not sure anyone would be actually interested to fix that, but maybe the spec shouldn't force the sync behavior either.",
