    "updated_at": "2024-04-18T14:44:53Z",
    "body": "Maybe, but we're not terribly consistent about this at the moment. E.g., `Notification.permission` does require active synchronization.\r\n\r\nThere might be some ways to get rid of that (at some point there was a proposal to always return \"`default`\" there), but thus far nobody has.",
